# Source art masters. ~47MB of full-resolution PNG/JPG delivered by the
# animation team; the site ships the optimised WebPs derived from them in
# public/assets/projects/showcase/, which ARE committed. Binaries this size
# can never be removed from git history once pushed, so they stay out —
# keep the masters in shared storage, or move them to Git LFS if they
# genuinely belong in the repo.
/public/assets/projects/Portfolio/
/public/assets/projects/Gigglebellies/
/public/assets/projects/Groovy-Martian/
/public/assets/projects/Monal-Kids/
/public/assets/projects/WnW/
